{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他发现对方仍然愿意亲近自己，于是想主动一些、大方地回应对方。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心动、期待、欣喜、忐忑\",\n      \"missed\": \"他已经开始期待两个人能长久，但又担心眼下的亲近不会一直持续，这两层矛盾需要读第二、第三段才能完整抓到。上方关于身体恢复弹性、玩心和调情般回应的小字，以及右侧四条情绪标签，也不容易一眼消化。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"对方依然亲近，他想主动回应，也开始想象两个人能一直这么好。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心动、期待、温暖、隐约不安\",\n      \"missed\": \"期待长久与害怕亲近不能持续之间的矛盾，需要再读黄色和灰色两段才能明确。右侧情绪标签较小，下方金色线点虽然有音乐流动感，但没有直接呈现人物处境或具体情绪。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他因为对方仍然愿意亲近而想主动回应，心里开始期待两个人的未来，却又没有把握这份亲近能持续多久。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心动、期待、温暖、怀念、忐忑\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的‘歌声没有落定，反而向上散开；后来忽然戛然而止，快乐余温尚在，心头却泛起怀念’是一整条较长的小字，扫一眼基本抓不全，也不容易立即看出音乐变化与人物心境的对应关系。上方关于身体和玩心的说明同样需要逐句读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"三段主句都比较长，而且字号和视觉分量接近。第一眼能抓到‘依然亲近’‘大大方方地回应’‘往后的日子都开始盼了’等关键词，但要读完才能串起主动回应、期待长久、害怕失去这三个层次。右侧四条情绪标签和第三张新增的音乐描写又提供了另一组信息，尤其音乐描写与人物处境之间的关系不够直接。整体故事是连贯的，主要问题是信息块偏多、每块都需要一定阅读时间，而不是内容彼此无关。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "475404db-43f7-4bdd-a0a3-36378cc101d5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T000450519948Z", "elapsed_seconds": 101.782, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:06:32.305943+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "229f9c63ab9f2281b1e8e0c55aa758b20ad3efc4650e6720cdfde8e2abc57999", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T000450519948Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "51c79b7e2770d771db88f41dcd3521b705a02a82cee8f395aec199042e301441"}}}
